# kk: Work around compute dispatch spilling issue on M1/2
# https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/46159 state=merged
# ### What does this MR do and why?
<!-- Describe in detail what your merge request does and why. -->

AI was used to investigate the issue and potential workarounds.

```
kk: Work around compute dispatch spilling issue on M1/2

Fixes Vulkan CTS tests:
dEQP-VK.clipping.*vert_tess_geom*
dEQP-VK.tessellation.geometry_interaction.*

See changes in docs/drivers/kosmickrisp/workarounds.rst for detailed
explanation on the bug and how we are working around it.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Aitor Camacho <aitor@lunarg.com>
